# 54. FINAL BACKEND REQUIREMENT

Build HEMORA as a secure, scalable Firebase backend that can support the existing React/TypeScript frontend and future Android application.

The backend must behave like a real blood-bank operational system while remaining strictly within appropriate medical boundaries.

The system must prioritize:

